     ],
     "children": [
      {
       "id": "n3755",
       "type": "frame",
       "name": "Open card #4",
       "width": "fill_container",
       "padding": [
        0,
        6
       ],
       "children": [
        {
         "id": "n3756",
         "type": "frame",
         "name": "Card",
         "width": "fill_container",
         "layout": "vertical",
         "padding": [
          10,
          10,
          10,
          10
         ],
         "gap": 8,
         "cornerRadius": [
          0,
          0,
          8,
          8
         ],
         "fill": "$raised",
         "stroke": "$border",
         "strokeWidth": 1,
         "children": [
          {
           "id": "n3757",
           "type": "text",
           "name": "Paragraph",
           "content": "The cart page and the receipt disagree because they do not share a helper, and order history loads the old script in its own head tag.",
           "fontFamily": "$ui",
           "fontSize": 12.5,
           "fill": "$fg",
           "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
           "width": "fill_container",
           "lineHeight": 1.5
          },
          {
           "id": "n3758",
           "type": "text",
           "name": "Paragraph",
           "content": "That tag is safe to remove, since nothing on the page reads the globals the script sets. The help pages are harder.",
           "fontFamily": "$ui",
           "fontSize": 12.5,
           "fill": "$fg",
           "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
           "width": "fill_container",
           "lineHeight": 1.5
          },
          {
           "id": "n3759",
           "type": "text",
           "name": "Heading",
           "content": "Help pages",
           "fontFamily": "$ui",
           "fontSize": 15,
           "fill": "$fg",
           "fontWeight": "500"
          },
          {
           "id": "n3760",
           "type": "text",
           "name": "Paragraph",
           "content": "The help pages load it through a template, and the template is generated, so the change belongs in the generator and not in the page.",
           "fontFamily": "$ui",
           "fontSize": 12.5,
           "fill": "$fg",
           "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
           "width": "fill_container",
           "lineHeight": 1.5
          },
          {
           "id": "n3761",
           "type": "text",
           "name": "Paragraph",
           "content": "The generator lives in tools/help, and its output is not checked in.",
           "fontFamily": "$ui",
           "fontSize": 12.5,
           "fill": "$fg",
           "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
           "width": "fill_container",
           "lineHeight": 1.5
          },
          {
           "id": "n3762",
           "type": "text",
           "name": "Heading",
           "content": "What I would do next",
           "fontFamily": "$ui",
           "fontSize": 15,
           "fill": "$fg",
           "fontWeight": "500"
          },
          {
           "id": "n3763",
           "type": "text",
           "name": "Paragraph",
           "content": "Remove the tag from the shared layout first, since that one change covers checkout and the order confirmation page at once.",
           "fontFamily": "$ui",
           "fontSize": 12.5,
           "fill": "$fg",
           "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
           "width": "fill_container",
           "lineHeight": 1.5
          },
          {
           "id": "n3764",
           "type": "text",
           "name": "Paragraph",
           "content": "Then remove the tag from order history, and change the help generator last, because its output only appears after the next docs build.",
           "fontFamily": "$ui",
           "fontSize": 12.5,
           "fill": "$fg",
           "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
           "width": "fill_container",
           "lineHeight": 1.5
          },
          {
           "id": "n3765",
           "type": "text",
           "name": "Paragraph",
           "content": "Once all three are gone, nothing imports the file and it can be deleted.",
           "fontFamily": "$ui",
           "fontSize": 12.5,
           "fill": "$fg",
           "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
           "width": "fill_container",
           "lineHeight": 1.5
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
